sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Cashier
  participant F as checkoutFn
  participant T as tenant.server
  participant S as data.server
  participant D as Turso
  participant X as Xendit

  C->>F: POST cart payload (Zod wire schema)
  F->>T: resolve tenant from session cookie
  T->>D: read membership + role
  T-->>F: tenantId + role
  F->>S: checkout(tenantId, input)
  S->>D: re-read prices and HPP
  S->>S: compute subtotal · discount · cost · profit
  S->>D: transaction: order + order_items
  S->>D: apply stock deltas + stock_movements
  S->>D: take order number from counters

  alt cash or credit
    S-->>C: order paid (credit stays unsettled)
  else QRIS
    S->>D: pending order + payments row
    S->>X: create fixed-amount QR
    X-->>S: QR_STRING + payment_request_id
    S-->>C: pending screen with QR
    X->>S: webhook (reference_id)
    S->>S: verify token · match attempt · compare amount
    S->>D: mark payment and order paid
  end
